body:
When sorting a vector of 257 non-empty strings, the result contains empty strings.

This does not seem to happen for shorter vectors (up to 256 elements).

The issue might be related to the temporary buffer that is used for inputs with more than 256 elements:
https://github.com/ericniebler/range-v3/blob/7e6f34b1e820fb8321346888ef0558a0ec842b8e/include/range/v3/algorithm/stable_sort.hpp#L205-L212

Minimal example:
https://godbolt.org/z/1fr4h88oW
```cpp
